<title>USA: Clinton, Saudi defense minister discuss oil.</title>
<headline>Clinton, Saudi defense minister discuss oil.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Deputy Prime Minister and Defense Minister Prince Sultan bin Abdul Aziz said he and President Clinton discussed economic and oil policies during their meeting Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;We have discussed of course the economic and oil policies and commercial polices and we have our colleagues, the special ministers for these areas, who will continue discussions with their counterparts,&quot; he told reporters.</p>
<p>&quot;Our most important interest is to serve the interest of the Saudi people and then that will also benefit the American people,&quot; he added.</p>
</text>
